>> title: Red Lentil Soup
>> category: Soups
>> tags: lentils, vegetarian, blender, weeknight
>> counters: Shawarma Counter
>> aka: mercimek çorbası, shorbat adas, adas, Turkish lentil soup, lentil soup
>> pairs-with: pita-bread
>> servings: 4
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: sweat 6 min
>> step.2: toast 1 min
>> step.3: simmer 30 min
>> step.4: purée smooth
>> step.5: season

Sweat @yellow onion{1%large} and @garlic{3%cloves} in @olive oil{3%Tbs} for ~{6%min}.

Toast @&(~1)aromatics{} for ~{1%min} with @tomato paste{2%Tbs}, @ground cumin{1 1/2%tsp}, and @red pepper flakes{1/4%tsp}.

Simmer @&(~1)base{} for ~{30%min} with @red lentils{1 1/2%cups}(300 g), @carrot{1%large}, and @vegetable stock{6%cups}(1.4 L; or water).

Purée @&(~1)soup{} until smooth with an #immersion blender{}.

Season @&(~1)soup{} with @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp} and @lemon juice{2%Tbs}.
